  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SIINC TA for Aqua Clara Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aqua Clara Kenya (ACK) is a social enterprise that sells water and sanitation solutions across East Africa to reduce cases of water borne diseases. ACK is registered as a Company Limited by Guarantee (non-profit), but has recently restructured to a hybrid business model that includes a subsidiary company Limited by Shares (for-profit) called Aqua Clara Solutions (ACS).The technical assistance (TA) alongside SIINC supports ACK in various areas, namely investment readiness, SIINC preparation, and capacity building. These projects have been identified as crucial steps for the organisation&apos;s growth and sustainability, and include:&#x2022; TA area 1: Branding and marketing strategy support&#x2022; TA area 2: Data baseline creation for SIINC transaction&#x2022; TA area 3: Inventory financing for mid-segment water filter container/bucket pilot</narrative>
  </description>
